  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk Forms | Newport, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     About Newport   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Contact Info  \t\t\t \n     Find It Fast   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Absentee Ballots & Voter Information Lookup \r\n\t\t\t Acceptable Proofs of Residency for Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t Buying/Selling Private Sale - This is information you need to know \r\n\t\t\t DOGS DOGS Everything DOGS \r\n\t\t\t Elections & Voting \r\n\t\t\t Supervisor of the Checklist Sessions and Elections for 2026 \r\n\t\t\t Town Clerk Forms \r\n\t\t\t Town of Newport Historical Book Digital Archive \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \nTown Clerk Forms \r\nTown Clerk Forms\t\t \r\nVehicles \nProof of Residency \nVin Verification  - TDMV 19A \nPower of Attorney \nNon-Resident Affidavit  - RDMV 1001 \nAntique Title - Affidavit of Ownership  - TDMV 105 \nLetter of Release  (giving your plate to another person) \nVanity Plate Application  - RDMV 120 \nAddress Change  - DSMV 30 \nPermission to Register  (if someone is coming in for you to register a new vehicle) \nDuplicate Title Application  - TDMV 18 \nCorporate Address Change  - RDMV 324 \nApplication for Replacement Plate(s) and/or Decal(s)  - RDMV 125 \nApplication for Duplicate Registration  - RDMV 110 \nGeneric Bill of Sale  - TDMV 22A \nParent/Guardian Authorization Certificate  - DSMV 38 (minor on a registration permission form) \nVerification of Residency by Homeowner/Landlord \nDogs \n2023 Top Dog Entry Form  (Dog must be registered with a 23- tag before entering contest.) \nVital Record Requests \nAll requests must be accompanied by a copy of the requestor's license or government issued photo ID. \nBirth Certificate Request \nMarriage Certificate Request \nDeath Certificate Request \nDivorce Certificate Request \nIf you are recently married and you elected to change your last name, you have to do that in a timely manner with DMV and SOCIAL SECURITY then everything else.  Click here to go to Social Security Administration site . Click on Personal Record for a name change.  Click here to get information on how to change your name with DMV . Click on Forms to the right in the blue ribbon. You are looking for the DSMV 30 form under Driver Licensing. \r\n\t\t\t Public Notices \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Town Meeting \r\n\t\t\t Forms & Permits \r\n\t\t\t Assessing Database \r\nTown of Newport \r\n15 Sunapee St \r\nNewport, NH 03773 \r\nPhone:  603-863-1877 \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
